# The public dog pages need nothing: the county feed is a public URL.
#
# The team portal (/signin, /team, /application) needs Supabase. Both of these
# are PUBLIC keys — they ship to the browser by design and every table is behind
# RLS. Copy this file to .env.local and fill them from the Supabase dashboard,
# Project Settings > API. The service role key belongs in neither file.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# Optional: overrides the address used for share cards and the sitemap.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
